  annote = {Opened the full recomposed edition. VIII Corollaire 7.7 and Proposition 7.8, recomposed pp.174–175/original pp.224–225: effective quasi-projective descent. IX Théorème 6.1, recomposed p.195/original p.253: arithmetic fundamental-group exact sequence, with its finite-descent proof. XII Théorème 5.1 and Corollaire 5.2, recomposed pp.251–253/original pp.333–337: complex comparison. XIII Corollaire 2.12, recomposed pp.290–291/original pp.392–393: tame generators, relation and prime-to-characteristic presentation. V is used as background for Galois categories, not as a claimed literal source for the entire arbitrary-automorphism extension lemma. Seminar 1960–1961; published 1971; recomposition circulated on arXiv from 2002.}
}

